<title>USA: Shaw Industries to acquire Carpet Exchange.</title>
<headline>Shaw Industries to acquire Carpet Exchange.</headline>
<dateline>DALTON, Ga. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shaw Industries Inc said on Thursday it reached an agreement in principle to acquire G&amp;S Investments Inc, which conducts business as The Carpet Exchange.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Seattle, Wash.-based Carpet Exchange operates about 22 stores in three states, the company said.</p>
</text>
